+# Sakhi Comprehensive Engineering Audit, Bug Fixes, UX Redesign & Security Hardening — Implementation Report
+
+- **Date:** November 7, 2026
+- **Repository:** [`siddubond007/women-safety-app`](https://github.com/siddubond007/women-safety-app)
+- **Baseline Branch:** [`module-8-to-9-implementations-and-upgrades`](https://github.com/siddubond007/women-safety-app/tree/module-8-to-9-implementations-and-upgrades) (Baseline SHA `ed6b387b4d4607352d305e9fdafe7718610bb405`, `main` SHA `d304f119e62c4be1c7624873f7ce0c5e2a53f2d5`)
+- **Isolated Delivery Branch:** `gemini/sakhi-comprehensive-fixes-20261107`
+- **Primary Requirements Baseline:** [Sakhi Women-Centric App SRS (`Women Centric App.docx` — Modules 1–12)](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1DK0om8qAtYw3eEyye84iSb9cPZ7JJ-Vh/edit)
+
+## 1. Executive Summary & Root-Cause Analysis
+
+| Section / Area | Audited Root Cause in Baseline (`ed6b387`) | Engineered Resolution on `gemini/sakhi-comprehensive-fixes-20261107` | Key Files Modified / Added |
+| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
+| **Section 4: Meditation & Breathing Voices, 42-Track Remote Delivery & LRU Cache** | `GuidedMeditationSessionController` used a single generic device TTS lookup and 5 static synth labels without onboarding, voice preview, server-saved preferences, or remote track downloading/caching. | Added the 5 approved neural voice profiles (`V22` `en-US-ElizabethNeural`, `V24` `en-CA-ClaraNeural`, `V26` `en-GB-SoniaNeural`, `V30` `en-IE-EmilyNeural`, `V01` `en-IN-NeerjaExpressiveNeural`) with live voice preview, `SakhiWellnessOnboardingWizardSheet`, backend endpoints (`GET/PUT /api/v1/module2/wellness/preferences`, `POST /api/v1/module2/wellness/session/prepare`, `GET /api/v1/module2/wellness/audio/:trackId/stream`), download-before-session with pure-Dart RFC 6234 SHA-256 verification (`SakhiSha256`), and a bounded 6-track / 15 MB / 7-day LRU cache with `Clear Cache`. | `backend/src/module2/wellness-audio-catalog.helper.ts`, `backend/src/module2/module2.service.ts`, `app/lib/features/wellness/widgets/guided_meditation_card.dart`, `app/lib/features/wellness/screens/wellness_screen.dart`, `app/android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/example/women_safety_app/MainActivity.kt` |
+| **Section 5: Emergency SOS Hardware Volume-Key False Triggers** | `MainActivity.kt` registered both `dispatchKeyEvent` and a global `android.media.VOLUME_CHANGED_ACTION` broadcast receiver that fired `HARDWARE_KEY_3X` whenever any 3 volume adjustments occurred within 3.5s, causing accidental SOS triggers while adjusting media volume. | Removed the `VOLUME_CHANGED_ACTION` broadcast trigger and implemented a deterministic two-stage state machine (`SosVolumeKeyStateMachine` in Kotlin + `SakhiTwoStageSosVolumeStateMachine` in Dart): **Stage 1** requires `3× KEYCODE_VOLUME_UP` (`ACTION_DOWN`, `repeatCount == 0`) within `2.5s` to arm an `8.0s` confirmation window with haptic cue and visible banner + Cancel button; **Stage 2** requires `3× KEYCODE_VOLUME_DOWN` within the `8.0s` armed window to confirm SOS, followed by a `15s` cooldown and `onPause`/`onResume` reset. Normal OS volume adjustment is never consumed (`super.dispatchKeyEvent(event)` always returned). | `app/android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/example/women_safety_app/MainActivity.kt`, `app/lib/features/safety/models/safety_models.dart`, `app/lib/features/safety/screens/safety_screen.dart` |
+| **Section 6: Menstrual Cycle Tracker Slider Bug, Layout Order, Median Algorithm & PDF Export** | 1) `Slider.onChanged` in `menstrual_cycle_tracker_screen.dart` called `_controller.updatePreferences(...)` on every drag tick, firing concurrent HTTP PATCH + `syncWithBackend()` requests whose out-of-order responses overwrote `averageCycleLength` (jumping around 29–35 days). 2) Period Pain articles were placed above the calendar. 3) Cycle export shared raw plain text instead of a formatted PDF document. | 1) Added local `_draftCustomCycleDays` state during drag + `onChangeEnd` persistence + `-`/`+` step buttons + sequence-guarded `updatePreferences`. 2) Upgraded `CyclePredictionEngine.compute` and backend `calculateMenstrualCyclePredictions` to use a **robust median** over the last 6 valid intervals (`15..60` days) with explicit `±uncertaintyRangeDays` window. 3) Reordered Tab 1 so the Full Interactive Monthly Calendar appears **above** Period Pain Help & 8 cited articles ([ACOG Dysmenorrhea FAQ](https://www.acog.org/womens-health/faqs/dysmenorrhea-painful-periods), [ACOG Fertility Awareness FAQ](https://www.acog.org/womens-health/faqs/fertility-awareness-based-methods-of-family-planning), [WHO PCOS Fact Sheet](https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/polycystic-ovary-syndrome), [WHO/UNICEF Menstrual Health Guide](https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/9789240050181)). 4) Built a pure-Dart `%PDF-1.4` document generator (`generateClinicalSummaryPdfBytes`) shared via `SharePlus` as `Sakhi_Menstrual_Cycle_Summary.pdf`. | `app/lib/features/wellness/models/menstrual_cycle_models.dart`, `app/lib/features/wellness/screens/menstrual_cycle_tracker_screen.dart`, `backend/src/module2/module2.service.ts` |
+| **Section 7: Messaging Polish, Quiet Hours & Active Circles Post-Join Channel** | 1) Direct chat lacked date separators, optimistic sending/failed/retry states, and in-chat Block/Report actions. 2) Tapping "Join" on an Active Circle only showed a snackbar with no post-join channel view. | 1) Upgraded `SakhiDirectConversationScreen` with verified member header, privacy banner, date separator pills, `SENDING`/`SENT`/`FAILED` + `Retry` bubble states, and `AppBar` Block & Report dialogs. 2) Added Quiet Hours (`22:00–07:00`) non-urgent push suppression while SOS/Safety alerts always bypass quiet hours. 3) Built `SakhiCommunityCircleChannelScreen` and backend endpoints (`GET /module2/circles/:circleId`, `POST /module2/circles`, `POST /module2/circles/:circleId/posts`, `PATCH /module2/circles/:circleId/posts/:postId/moderate`) with `OWNER`/`MODERATOR`/`MEMBER` roles, rules, pinned announcements, and discussion feed. | `app/lib/features/notifications/screens/messages_and_notifications_inbox_screens.dart`, `app/lib/features/notifications/screens/notification_preferences_screen.dart`, `app/lib/features/explore/screens/explore_discovery_screens.dart`, `backend/src/module2/module2.service.ts`, `backend/src/module2/module2.controller.ts` |
+| **Section 8 & 9: Profile Photo Lightbox + Crop/EXIF Scrubber, Search Alignment, Frosted Glass & Home Hero Woman Animation** | 1) Profile photo uploads skipped interactive square crop/rotate preview and client-side JPEG EXIF stripping. 2) `SakhiSearchField` text sat slightly off-center vertically. 3) Home greeting banner used a static pose without back-to-front entrance reveal or continuous slow-breeze hair motion. | 1) Added circular 1:1 crop/zoom/rotate preview dialog + client-side JPEG `APP1`/`APP13` EXIF/GPS segment stripper (`_stripJpegExifSegments`) in `ProfileScreen` and full-screen pinch-to-zoom lightbox on both own and member profiles. 2) Centered `SakhiSearchField` (`textAlignVertical: TextAlignVertical.center`, `isCollapsed: true`, optional debounce). 3) Added `SakhiAnimatedHomeHeroWoman` (900ms back-to-front reveal + continuous 3.6s multi-harmonic slow-breeze hair motion + `MediaQuery.disableAnimationsOf` fallback) and centered `WellnessCategoryTile` geometry. | `app/lib/features/profile/screens/profile_screen.dart`, `app/lib/features/explore/screens/explore_discovery_screens.dart`, `app/lib/core/widgets/sakhi_search_field.dart`, `app/lib/core/widgets/sakhi_wellness_illustrations.dart`, `app/lib/features/home/widgets/greeting_banner_card.dart`, `app/lib/features/wellness/widgets/wellness_category_tile.dart` |
